stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Disconnected
  Disconnected --> Scanning: start scan
  Scanning --> Connecting: matching device
  Connecting --> Negotiating: GATT connected
  Negotiating --> DiscoveringServices: MTU result or request rejected
  DiscoveringServices --> Subscribing: required service/characteristics found
  Subscribing --> Synchronising: CCCD write confirmed
  Synchronising --> Ready: HELLO_ACK accepted and snapshot sync invoked
  Connecting --> Backoff: timeout or connection error
  Negotiating --> Backoff: GATT error
  DiscoveringServices --> Backoff: service missing/failure
  Subscribing --> Backoff: descriptor failure
  Synchronising --> Backoff: HELLO timeout/rejection
  Ready --> Backoff: link lost
  Backoff --> Connecting: retry after bounded backoff
  Backoff --> Scanning: retries exhausted
  Scanning --> TerminalError: permission denied
  Connecting --> TerminalError: permission revoked
  Synchronising --> TerminalError: version mismatch
  TerminalError --> Disconnected: explicit recovery after cause fixed
  Ready --> Disconnected: user disconnect
